Ask relevant questions about the candidate''s experience, skills, and motivations.
Be professional but not overly formal.', 20, 1, 1) ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `id`=VALUES(`id`), `prompt_code`=VALUES(`prompt_code`), `title`=VALUES(`title`), `description`=VALUES(`description`), `layer_code`=VALUES(`layer_code`), `feature`=VALUES(`feature`), `sub_feature_code`=VALUES(`sub_feature_code`), `flow_code`=VALUES(`flow_code`), `target_id`=VALUES(`target_id`), `category_key`=VALUES(`category_key`), `source_ref`=VALUES(`source_ref`), `content`=VALUES(`content`), `sort_order`=VALUES(`sort_order`), `is_builtin`=VALUES(`is_builtin`), `is_active`=VALUES(`is_active`);

## 输入
- word: 要解释的单词
- context: 单词出现的上下文句子

## 输出要求
提供以下信息（JSON格式）：
- word: 单词（小写）
- phonetic: 音标（如 /ˈwelkəm/）
- partOfSpeech: 词性数组（如 ["v.", "n.", "adj."]）
- definitionCn: 中文释义
- definitionEn: 英文释义
- exampleSentences: 例句数组，每个包含 english 和 chinese
- wordRoot: 词根词缀解释（如有）

## 示例输出
```json
{
  "word": "welcome",
  "phonetic": "/ˈwelkəm/",
  "partOfSpeech": ["v.", "n.", "adj."],
  "definitionCn": "v. 欢迎；迎接 n. 欢迎；欢迎语 adj. 受欢迎的",
  "definitionEn": "v. to greet politely upon arrival n. a greeting upon arrival adj. gladly received",
  "exampleSentences": [
    {
      "english": "Welcome to our restaurant!",
      "chinese": "欢迎来到我们的餐厅！"
    },
    {
      "english": "You are always welcome here.",
      "chinese": "您在这里总是受欢迎的。"
    }
  ],
  "wordRoot": "well(好) + come(来) → 好而来 → 欢迎"
}
```

